          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Die Regel merkt sich"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The text the next row like this one is recognised by — shorter is usually better: “Tenmanya” rather than the whole line." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Der Text, an dem die nächste Buchung wie diese erkannt wird — kürzer ist meist besser: „Tenmanya“ statt der ganzen Zeile."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The trade history has gaps — the return is an approximation." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
